{"title":"Dinner Lady Salts","description":"\u003cp\u003eDinner Lady products are designed in-house by our dedicated product team, to deliver a superior vaping experience. Using only the best quality ingredients, Dinner Lady nicotine salts is carefully crafted in the UK, under stringent quality controls to meet the UK government’s Medicines and Healthcare Products Regulatory Agency. Shop Dinner Lady nicotine salts at best price in Kenya with free cash on delivery.\u003c\/p\u003e","products":[{"product_id":"core-salt-pink-lemonade","title":"Core Salt Pink Lemonade","description":"\u003cp\u003ePink Lemonade Core Dinner lady Salt is a classic summer taste. A fusion of rich, sweet, and tart red berries, blended with cloudy lemonade and crushed ice.\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ca title=\"Dinner Lady Salts\" href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/dinner-lady-salts\"\u003eDinner Lady\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAvailable Strength: 30 and 50MG\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePG\/VG: 50\/50\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSize: 30ML\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePrimary Flavors: Lemonade, Berries, Menthol\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMade In: UK\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Dinner Lady","offers":[{"title":"20MG","offer_id":41761728397367,"sku":"69d2603c0ce1b","price":1589.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"30MG","offer_id":41761728430135,"sku":"69d2603c89aa6","price":1589.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"50MG","offer_id":41761728462903,"sku":"69d2603d2264e","price":1589.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/core-dinner-lady-salt-pink-lemonade.webp?v=1756170166"},{"product_id":"core-salt-tropic-mango-chill","title":"Core Salt Tropic Mango Chill","description":"\u003cp\u003eTropic Mango Chill Core Dinner Lady Salt is a classic summer taste. A deliciously chilled tro