et, velvety, rich, and creamy custard blend.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cf0\"\u003eManufacturer: Dinner Lady\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cf0\"\u003eFlavor: Vanilla, Custard, Sweet and Creamy\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cf0\"\u003eFormula : Nicotine Salt\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cf0\"\u003eNicotine Strength: 30mg \/ 50mg\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cf0\"\u003eBottle Size: 30ml\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cf0\"\u003eMade in the UK\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c!--EndFragment --\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Dinner Lady","offers":[{"title":"20MG","offer_id":41761728921655,"sku":"69d260410c43a","price":1589.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"30MG","offer_id":41761728954423,"sku":"69d2604194ae0","price":1589.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"50MG","offer_id":41761728987191,"sku":"69d260422bed3","price":1589.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/Core-by-DINNER-LADY-Vanilla-Custard-Salt-min.jpg?v=1751837316"},{"product_id":"core-salt-tropic-thunder","title":"Core Salt Tropic Thunder","description":"\u003cp\u003eTropic Thunder Core Dinner Lady Salt is a classic summer taste. An electric fusion of worldly tropical fruits! Top notes of rich Pineapple, Mango \u0026amp; Guava, to mid notes of crisp Apple, Citric fruits, and sweet passion fruits!\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"\u003eManufacturer: Dinner Lady\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"\u003eFlavor: Pineapple, Mango and Guava\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cspan style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"\u003eFormula: \u003c\/span\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/nic-salts\" title=\"Salt nicotine\"\u003eSalt Nicotine \u003c\/a\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"\u003eNicotine Strength: 30mg \/ 50mg\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"\u003eBottle Size: 30ml\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"\u003eMade in the UK\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Dinner Lady","offers":[{"title":"20MG","offer_id":41761729052727,"sku":"69d25fe71510b","price":1589.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"30MG","offer_id":41761729085495,"sku":"69d25fe7a2416","price":1589.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"50MG","offer_id":41761729118263,"sku":"69d25fe83fe76","price":1589.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/Core-by-Dinner-Lady-Tropic-Thunder-Nic-Salt-min.jpg?v=1751837319"},{"product_id":"core-salt-grape-vine","title":"Core Salt Grape Vine","description":"\u003cp\u003eGrape Vine Core Dinner Lady Salt is a classic summer taste. Marvin called this out in 1968. ‘’I heard it through the grape-vine’’. Purple and Red grapes, sweet, slightly sour, and punchy.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"\u003eManufacturer: Dinner Lady\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"\u003eFlavor: Grape, Sweet and Sour\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/nic-salts\" title=\"Nic Salts Online in Kenya\"\u003e Formula: Salt Nicotine \u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"\u003eNicotine Strength: 30mg \/ 50mg\u003c\/span\u