"title":"20MG","offer_id":41761729347639,"sku":"69d25fe712398","price":1589.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"30MG","offer_id":41761729380407,"sku":"69d25fe79ca17","price":1589.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"50MG","offer_id":41761729413175,"sku":"69d25fe838705","price":1589.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/Core-by-DINNER-LADY-Honeydew-Melonade-Salt-min.jpg?v=1751837323"},{"product_id":"dinner-lady-salts-pink-berry","title":"Dinner Lady Salts - Pink Berry","description":"\u003cp\u003eA cocktail of sweet citrus, mixed berries and nicotine salts that’s fruity and fun.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAvailable in: 30mg and 50mg.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBlend: VG\/PG - 50\/50\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBottle Size: 30ml\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDinner Lady from the UK has won numerous prestigious international awards and has products flying off the shelves in 96 countries. You can also buy\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/dinner-lady-salts\" title=\"dinner lady\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003edinner lady\u003c\/a\u003e from us!\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Dinner Lady","offers":[{"title":"30MG","offer_id":41762031206455,"sku":"69d25fec0b34f","price":1499.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"50MG","offer_id":41762031239223,"sku":"69d25fec9a7ce","price":1499.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/dinner-lady-salts-pink-berry.jpg?v=1751853977"},{"product_id":"dinner-lady-ice-moments-peach-bubble","title":"Dinner Lady Ice Moments - Peach Bubble","description":"\u003cdiv class=\"product-name\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"title\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"product-name\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"title\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"product-name\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"title\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"product-name\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"title\"\u003eDinner Lady’s Peach Bubble combines ripe peaches fused with a taste of sweet bubble gum, to provide vapers with a unique flavour to remember. Containing PG and food-grade flavourings, Dinner Lady Concentrates are ideal for experienced vapers looking to personalise their vaping experience.\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eQuantity: 30ml e liquid concentrated with nicotine.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eNicotine Strength:  \u003cem\u003e50mg and 30mg\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cem\u003eVG\/PG: 50\/50\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Dinner Lady","offers":[{"title":"30MG","offer_id":41762047524919,"sku":"69d25ff10e069","price":1499.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"50MG","offer_id":41762047557687,"sku":"69d25ff19864e","price":1499.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/Dinner-Lady-Moments-Peach-Bubble-30ml.jpg?v=1751854445"},{"product_id":"dinner-lady-ice-moments-grape-star","title":"Dinner Lady Ice Moments - Grape Star","description":"\u003cdiv class=\"product-name\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"title\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv data-mce-fragment=\"1\" class=\"product-name\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv data-mce-fragment=\"1\" class=\"title\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"product-name\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"title\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"product-name\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"title\"\u003eDinner Lady’s Grape Star is part of our new Moments range. The profile combines fruity red and black grapes, with an added kick of aniseed koolada which delivers an icy, consistent, and completely unique taste. Containing PG and food-grade flavourings, Dinner Lady Concentrates are ideal for experienced vapers looking to personalise their vaping experience.\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eQuantity: 30ml e liquid concentrated with nicotine.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eNicotine Strength:  \u003cem\u003e50mg and 30mg\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cem\u003eVG\/PG: 50\/50\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Dinner Lady","offers":[{"title":"30MG","offer_id":41762047590455,"sku":"69d25ff10bfe4","price":1499.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"50MG","offer_id":41762047623223,"sku":"69d25ff1988a2","price":1499.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/Dinner-Lady-Moments-Ice-Grape-Star-30ml.jpg?v=1751854447"},{"product_id":"dinner-lady-salts-berry-blast","title":"Dinner Lady Salts Berry Blast","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eDinner Lady's Berry Blast concentrate is already in the pantheon of colorful fruity DIYs. To a nice crunchy cherry, a delicate raspberry was added to sweeten the whole. What a balancing act!\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eQuantity: 30ml e liquid concentrated with nicotine.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNicotine Strength:  50mg\u003cem data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e and 30mg\u003c\/em\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cem data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eVG\/PG: 50\/50\u003c\/em\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cem data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Dinner Lady","offers":[{"title":"30MG