end of watermelon and fruits, with 50:50 e-liquid is great for new vapers.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWatermelon Slices is a part of the Dinner Lady Fruits range, a collection that includes refreshing fruit combinations inspired by those flavors we fondly remember from times gone by.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eQuantity: 30ml e liquid concentrated with nicotine.\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNicotine Strength: 50mg and 30mg\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVG\/PG: 50\/50\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Dinner Lady","offers":[{"title":"30MG","offer_id":41762049556535,"sku":"69d2605f126d7","price":1499.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"50MG","offer_id":41762049589303,"sku":"69d2605fa3826","price":1499.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/Watermelon-Slices-Dinner-Lady-Nic-Salts.jpg?v=1751854479"},{"product_id":"dinner-lady-salts-bubble-trouble","title":"Dinner Lady Salts Bubble Trouble","description":"\u003cp\u003eChewy pink bubble gum is an experience that'll take you down memory lane. Dinner lady Bubble Trouble is a spot-on bubble gum flavor that won't have you looking anywhere else.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eQuantity: 30ml e liquid concentrated with nicotine.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eNicotine Strength:  \u003cem\u003e50mg and 30mg\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cem\u003eVG\/PG: 50\/50\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Dinner Lady","offers":[{"title":"30MG","offer_id":41762049622071,"sku":"69d2600516c57","price":1499.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"50MG","offer_id":41762049654839,"sku":"69d26005bf58d","price":1499.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/Bubble-Trouble-by-Dinner-Lady-Salts.jpg?v=1751854481"},{"product_id":"dinner-lady-salts-strawberry-bikini","title":"Dinner Lady Salts Strawberry Bikini","description":"\u003cp\u003eStrawberry and crushed cold ice in lemonade, slightly acidic. Are you tempted? Strawberry Bikini – Dinner Lady Salts is a fruity blend of strawberry and lemonade, Strawberry Bikini incorporates koolada for a refreshing lemon exhale.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eQuantity: 30ml e liquid concentrated with nicotine.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eNicotine Strength: \u003cem\u003e50mg and 30mg\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ci\u003e50% VG\/ 50% PG\u003c\/i\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Dinner Lady","offers":[{"title":"30MG","offer_id":41762050146359,"sku":"69d2600513ca3","price":1499.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"50MG","offer_id":41762050179127,"sku":"69d26005bc332","price":1499.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/dinner-lady-salts-strawberry-bikini-30ml-50mg-premium-salt.jpg?v=1751854483"},{"product_id":"dinner-lady-salts-san-tan-mango","title":"Dinner Lady Salts San Tan Mango","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eIf you crave juicy, sweet mango flavor, you need to pick up a bottle of Sun Tan Mango vape juice from Summer Holidays. Sun Tan Mango nic salt is a gorgeous juice that bathes ripe mangoes in sticky honey and tops it all off with cool menthol to soothe your palate. To call Sun Tan Mango salts refreshing would be an understatement.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eQuantity: 30ml e liquid concentrated with nicotine.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eNicotine Strength: \u003cem\u003e50mg and 30mg\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ci\u003e50% VG\/ 50% PG\u003c\/i\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Dinner Lady","offers":[{"title":"30MG","offer_id":41762050211895,"sku":"69d2600515169","price":1499.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"50MG","offer_id":41762050244663,"sku":"69d26005aeae4","price":1499.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/Dinner-Lady-Salts-Sun-Tan-Mango.jpg?v=1751854485"},{"product_id":"dinner-lady-salts-flip-flop-lychee","title":"Dinner Lady Salts Flip Flop Lychee","description":"\u003cp\u003eFlip Flop Lychee by Dinner Lady is an exotic blend of Asian Lychees, citrus, and ice. Do you love fruity vape juice flavors? Are you ready to try something that’s a little different? If so, Dinner Lady has a flavor that you are going to love. Flip Flop Lychee vape juice is a succulent blend of sweet lychee flavor, stunning citrus fruits and a cold shot of menthol. This flavor extravaganza will refresh your palate with every inhale and exhale.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIt is the middle of summer, meaning that we are all craving those refreshing fruity flavors more than ever. Thankfully, Dinner Lady has come to our rescue with Flip Flop Lychee vape juice. Flip Flop Lychee is a yummy liquid that is exploding with exotic and bright fruity goodness that will make your palate feel absolutely refreshed and satisfied after just one puff.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eQuantity: 30ml e liquid concentrated with nicotine.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eNicotine Strength: \u003cem\u003e50mg and 30mg\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ci\u003e50% VG\/ 50% PG\u003c\/i\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Dinner Lady","offers":[{"title":"30MG","offer_id":41762050277431,"sku":"69d2600a0e568","price":1499.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"50MG","offer_id":41762050310199,"sku":"69d2600a9a6f7","price":1499.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/Dinner-Lady-Salts-Flip-Flop-Lychee-Vape-Shop.jpg?v=1751854487"},{"product_id":"dinner-lady-salts-watermelon-slices-with-ice","title":"Dinner Lady Salts Watermelon Slices with Ice","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eWatermelon Slices Ice\u003c\/em\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eis a nostalgic treat designed by Dinner Lady’s team of experts to evoke fond childhood memories.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis tropical fruit nicotine salt highlights the juicy, refreshing sweetness of natural watermelon and adds a blend of other fruits to mimic the eponymous\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cem\u003ePick ‘N’ Mix \u003c\/em\u003ecandy. The mixture acquires an extra layer of depth with the koolada, which provides a sharp, ice-cold sensation that elevates\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cem\u003eWatermelon Slices Ice \u003c\/em\u003eto the next level.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eQuantity: 30ml salt concentrated with nicotine.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eNicotine Strength:  \u003cem\u003e50mg and 30mg\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003ci\u003e50% VG\/ 50% Pg\u003c\/i\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003c\/em\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Dinner Lady","offers":[{"title":"30MG","offer_id":41762050342967,"sku":"69d2600a0e92b","price":1499.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"50MG","offer_id":41762050375735,"sku":"69d2600a9f35e","price":1499.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/DinnerLady-Ice-WaterMelon-Slices-Ice-Salts-30mg-30ml.jpg?v=1751854490"},{"product_id":"dinner-lady-salts-apple-sours-ice","title":"Dinner Lady Salts Apple Sours Ice","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003